# The fonts the code of the pages names and their pictures are drawn in, made by DGX as a program's build makes the
# needs of the cookbook's "What the recipes share": soft edges, 4 bits a pixel, a face the rules choose. With the
# letters of the cookbook in both languages and of the pictures' program.
rules fonts.rules
need body
size 13px
bits 4
text ../../docs/en/cookbook.md
text ../../docs/ru/cookbook.md
text pictures.c
need large
size 32px
bits 4
text ../../docs/en/cookbook.md
text ../../docs/ru/cookbook.md
text pictures.c
need keys
size 20px
bits 4
letters 0123456789
need clock
size 40pt
bits 4
letters 0123456789:
need caption
size 12pt
bits 4
text ../../docs/en/cookbook.md
text ../../docs/ru/cookbook.md
